      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuprofwetu wamweniyi kaprofwetu Habakuki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova, nukudila dile-e kushika kumwakanyi chakadi eyikutiya? Nabidiki kudeyi jamadombu, eyi kwamwina nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanmwekeshelaŋadi kuluwa? Wantalishilaŋadi kuyuma yakala? Muloŋa kumesu ami kudi nakumwekana nikukisaŋana nimadombu, kudi nakunyamuka nikuzuŋazuŋa niyidjokojola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi nshimbi jazeya dehi, wuŋaji hiwamwekanaŋaku. Antu atama hiyakukuchika antu aloŋa; dichi wuŋaji chiwukumwekana wunaheŋi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mudi munyuza, talenu mumoni, muhayami nimukanwa loku. Muloŋa ami nukukoŋa mudimu mumafuku enu, mudimu owu himukuwitiyaku hela akuyishimwinawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa tiyenu, ami nakanyamuna aKaladeya, muza wukweti ndulu, wanyakala kuzuwa; watambatambaŋa mwatohela iseki kulonda atambuli nyikala yambala yawakwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyitala wutiya niwoma nikuzaala. Niwuŋaji wawu ni kulema kwawu kwakudinka awenawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuwalu twawu twabadika yiseŋantambu lufuchi, abadika tuŋiwidi twamelela kuzuwa; akwatuwalu twawu atandamaŋa, eŋa, akwatuwalu twawu afumaŋa kwakulehi, atúukaŋa neyi ambuulu anyakalaŋa kuya nakuvwota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakwinzawu wejima wawu akulonda wowu madombu hohu; kumesu awukudi chipepa chidi neyimpepela yakumusela; akuŋulaŋa ankoli neyi wusekulula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asehaŋa anyanta ankanu, atulamba ayimona adi neyi akuhemesha; yipaka yejima mwadikaŋilaŋawu antu ayiyiŋilaŋa, alumbikaŋaku maseki hiyakuyitambula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu wakahita naŋovu neyi mpepela, wakapandakana, wakatanya. Nzambi yindi joji Ŋovu jindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova Nzambi yami, eyi Wami Wajila, hiwudi wakufumisha kunyaka yahaya nyakaku? Hitwakafwaku. Eyi Yehova, wunamufuukwili kumusompesha; nineyi, eyi Ilola, wunamushimatishi kulonda kubabesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi wukweti mesu atooka abulaŋa kutwesha kubanjila yatama, abulaŋa kutwesha kutala yaheŋa, muloŋanyi watalaŋa antu akwatilaŋa akwawu makasu, hiwukumwena nizo-o helaŋa muntu watama hakumuminya mukwawu wamubadika kuloŋa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋanyi wabalumunaŋa antu hiyakwikala neyi inshi jamukaluŋalwiji, hela neyi yuma yazalalaŋa, yabula nyuli yawu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wayikwataŋa wejima wawu nelowa, wayikwataŋa nakaleŋi kindi, wayikuŋulaŋa muchikokela chindi. Dichi chazaŋalelaŋayi, hakuluŋa nikuluŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi hakupesha nikaleŋi kindi, hakwochela nichikokela chindi yuma yamavumba amawahi; muloŋa diku kwatohelenayi mujimba windi, kwadiilaŋayi niyuma yindi yayiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komana asukuli tuhu kwindi kaleŋi kindi abuli kwanakena kujaha nyuza hefuku hefuku?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
